    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "61 Woodlands is a well-proportioned four bedroom semi-detached family home offering an excellent opportunity for those looking to create their ideal home. With generous accommodation throughout and fantastic potential, this property is ready for its next owners to add their own personal style. This property benefits from its convenient location to Navan and a south-facing, very private rear garden allowing plenty of sunshine and many other features. The property definitely has the charm of well-settled area and will appeal to those looking for a home close to Navan town. \nEarly viewings are highly recommended.\n\nWoodlands is located within walking distance to Navan town centre with amenities near by including shops, restaurants, schools and Beachmount Shopping Centre with Supervalu. Mercy Convent National School, St. Josephs Mercy Secondary School and Beaufort College are all within walking distance from the property. Access to M3 motorway linking Navan town to Dublin City Airport is easily reached.\n\nGROUND FLOOR\n\nEntrance Hall: 1.75m x 3.40m\nwith under stairs storage\n\nGuest W.C.: 0.84m x 1.51m\n\nSitting room: 3.54m x 4.66m\nwith open fire place and double doors to the dining room\n\nDining room: 3.21m x 4.13m\nwith patio doors to garden\n\nKitchen: 3.03m x 4.60m\nSpacious kitchen open to the dining room\n\nBack hall: 1.70m x 1.60m\nwith storage closet and skylight\n\nDual access multipurpose room: 2.48m x 4.99m\nSpacious room with built in wardrobe and dual access from the back hall and own front door. Could be used for a variety of uses such as extra living space, a bedroom, home office or many more.\n\nWet room: 2.48m x 2.10m\n\nFIRST FLOOR\n\nLanding: 0.95m x 2.87m\nwith hot press\n\nBedroom 1: 3.22m x 4.14m\nFront bedroom, filled with natural light and has a built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2: 3.02m x 3.24m\nfront bedroom with built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom: 1.97m x 1.93m\nGenerous sized family bathroom\n\nBedroom 3: 3.22m x 3.80m\nwith built in wardrobe and open shelving, overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 4: 3.02m x 2.57m\nwith built in wardrobe, overlooking the rear garden.\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
